ype": "subtitle", "time": 16302.389, "timestamp": "04:31:42", "text": "并调整宽度和高度。是啊，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16304.55, "timestamp": "04:31:44", "text": "把它放下来，然后试着……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16308.87, "timestamp": "04:31:48", "text": "调整一下。是的，如果你想测试一下的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16312.87, "timestamp": "04:31:52", "text": "像看YouTube直播一样观看大型主播的直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16315.269, "timestamp": "04:31:55", "text": "就像一场直播或者其他什么随机事件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16317.11, "timestamp": "04:31:57", "text": "YouTube 直播间里有很多人"}]